{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 40, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "**A Whirlwind Adventure in Japan**\n\nJapan offered a perfect blend of tradition and modern wonder during my recent trip. The journey began in **Tokyo**, where neon lights illuminated the streets of **Shinjuku** and **Shibuya**, contrasting with the serene **Senso-ji Temple** in Asakusa. Sampling fresh sushi at **Tsukiji Outer Market** and trying rakugan (traditional comedy storytelling) left me enchanted.\n\nNext, I escaped to **Kyoto**, the heart of Japan’s cultural heritage. Wandering through **Fushimi Inari Shrine’s** iconic red torii gates at dawn was magical. The **Kinkaku-ji (Golden Pavilion)** gleamed under the sunlight, while **Arashiyama’s bamboo forest** felt like stepping into another world. A tea ceremony in a quiet ryokan made the experience even more immersive.\n\nThen, it was off to **Hiroshima**, where the **Peace Memorial Park** offered a poignant reminder of history. The **Itsukushima Shrine** in nearby **Miyajima**, floating on the water at high tide, left me breathless.\n\nThe trip ended in **Osaka**, where **Dotonbori’s** vibrant street food stalls (try the takoyaki!) and **Osaka Castle** grounded me before flying home.\n\nJapan’s efficiency, hospitality, and beauty made it unforgettable. From futuristic cities to ancient temples, every moment felt like a postcard come to life.", "logprobs": [{"token": "**", "logprob": -0.06942010670900345}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.35668447613716125}, {"token": " Wh", "logprob": -0.04385815188288689}, {"token": "irl", "logprob": -0.0221111997961998}, {"token": "wind", "logprob": -8.666139910928905e-05}, {"token": " Adventure", "logprob": -1.050450325012207}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.08222673088312149}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.006746845785528421}, {"token": "**\n\n", "logprob": -0.07589148730039597}, {"token": "Japan", "logprob": -1.334382176399231}, {"token": " off